  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">European initiative for the promotion of gender equality and the eradication of gender-based violence in Peru</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Overall Objective of this actions is to contribute to the promotion of gender equality and the eradication of gender-based violence in Peru.The Specific Objectives of this action are to:1) Adopt and strengthen sound policies and enforceable legislation for the prevention of gender discrimination and gender-based violence, 2) Promote the recognition of the gender gap in the use of time and the unequal distribution of household and caring tasks so to contribute to the debate and definition of a national care system, and 3) Increase women, girls and LGBTIQ+ people&#xb4;s access to information for the exercise of their rights, and justice in case of discrimination and GBV.</narrative>
  </description>
